                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.154/359: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Honduras</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Higgins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-28T17:00:00-06:00">October 28, 1931—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>177. Department’s instruction No. 188 October 15, 1931.<anchor n="45"
                        xml:id="d553-f1"/> Permission granted for aerial surveys for Inter-American
                    Highway.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Higgins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
